1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,160
I'm going to take you from cloud beginner to cloud expert first, give it the outcome.

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:07,760
If it knows the ultimate goal, it'll work backwards to give you the best answer.

3
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:10,240
Tell it you need to find 20 new customers a month.

4
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:15,200
Then give it the task. Find me 50 leads that our ideal customers are potential buyers from my business.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,520
After that, give it the context. If you have any documents to explain what your business does,

6
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:22,720
give it all to it because the more context the better the answer is going to be.

7
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:26,000
And then finally give it the format. How do you want it back?

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,400
You might ask it to put it in a spreadsheet, even say things like put this in 7th grade English

9
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:35,600
because I want to make it simple. If you do that, your cloud responses will be 200% better every time.

